{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42812","headline":"登郡楼书怀 二 · 刘兼","name":"登郡楼书怀 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"边郡荒凉悲且歌，故园迢遰隔烟波。\n琴声背俗终如是，剑气冲星又若何。\n朝客渐通书信少，钓舟频引梦魂多。\n北山更有移文者，白首无尘归去麽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42812.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42812","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}